  "text": "proprium.dedicatio-archibasilicae-sanctissimi-salvatoris-secreta",
  "about": "The secreta of the formulary “Dedication of the Archbasilica of the Most Holy Savior” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Look with favor upon our prayers, we beseech You, O Lord, that as we offer our prayers before You, we may, with Your help attain eternal rewards. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
